---
---
<section id="transport" class="py-16">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4">
    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-2">Getting to Shenzhen Beaches</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8">Most beaches are on the eastern Dapeng Peninsula.</p>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-200">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-ocean/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1a5f7a" stroke-width="2"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M8 18h8M12 4v14"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Metro</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Line 8 serves Dameisha and Xiaomeisha directly. For eastern beaches, take Line 2/3 to connecting buses. Fastest on weekends when roads jam.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-200">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#b45309" stroke-width="2"><rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13"/><polygon points="16 8 22 12 16 16 16 8"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Bus</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Express bus E11: city center to Nanao/Dapeng. Local buses M231, M232 connect to individual beaches. Cheapest option.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-200">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#15803d" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 18a2 2 0 1 0 0-4 2 2 0 0 0 0 4zM7 18a2 2 0 1 0 0-4 2 2 0 0 0 0 4z"/><path d="M17 16H7M17 8l2 8H5l2-8h10z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Taxi / Ride-hail</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Didis are plentiful. 50-80 min from city center (80-190 RMB). Best convenience-to-cost ratio for groups.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-200">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#7c3aed" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Driving</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Most flexible but limited parking. Avoid peak weekend/holiday hours. Roads to Dapeng are scenic but narrow.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>